  "_comment": [
    "FamilyAddons chat translator dictionaries.",
    "A copy of this file is written to config/familyaddons/translator_slang.json on first run;",
    "edit that copy and run /fa tr reload to pick up changes. Delete it to fall back to these defaults.",
    "",
    "protectedTerms  - words hidden from the translator so they come back unchanged.",
    "protectedPatterns - regexes doing the same for things like t5, f7, 10m.",
    "expansions      - chat shorthand rewritten to full words BEFORE translating, per source language.",
    "                  'common' is always applied; the language section is picked by detection.",
    "                  Keys may be whole phrases with spaces (see 'ar'); those are replaced first.",
    "postFixes       - literal-translation artifacts rewritten AFTER translating, per target language."
  ],

